  "//html/body/main/nav": "<nav class=\"toc\" aria-labelledby=\"h-toc\" data-faq-indice=\"\">",
  "//html/body/main/nav/h2": "<h2 id=\"h-toc\">In questa pagina</h2>",
  "//html/body/main/nav/ol": "<ol>",
  "//html/body/main/nav/ol/li[1]": "<li>",
  "//html/body/main/nav/ol/li[1]/a": "<a href=\"#sostenitori\">Per chi sostiene un progetto</a>",
  "//html/body/main/nav/ol/li[2]": "<li>",
  "//html/body/main/nav/ol/li[2]/a": "<a href=\"#promotori\">Per chi propone un progetto</a>",
  "//html/body/main/nav/ol/li[3]": "<li>",
  "//html/body/main/nav/ol/li[3]/a": "<a href=\"#generali\">Domande generali</a>",
  "//html/body/main/nav/ol/li[4]": "<li>",
  "//html/body/main/nav/ol/li[4]/a": "<a href=\"#parole\">Le parole di ideaBlume</a>",
  "//html/body/main/nav/ol/li[5]": "<li>",
  "//html/body/main/nav/ol/li[5]/a": "<a href=\"#non-trovato\">Non hai trovato la risposta?</a>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]": "<section id=\"sostenitori\" aria-labelledby=\"h-sostenitori\" data-faq-gruppo=\"\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/h2": "<h2 id=\"h-sostenitori\">Per chi sostiene un progetto</h2>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/h3[1]": "<h3>Donazioni e pagamenti</h3>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]": "<div class=\"accordion\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[1]": "<details id=\"faq-libera\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[1]/summary": "<summary>Posso donare senza scegliere una ricompensa?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[1]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[1]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[1]/div/p[1]": "<p>Sì. Scegli «Donazione libera» e scrivi l'importo, da €&nbsp;5 in su.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[1]/div/p[2]": "<p>Le ricompense sono solo un ringraziamento: non sono obbligatorie.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[2]": "<details id=\"faq-minimo\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[2]/summary": "<summary>Qual è l'importo minimo?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[2]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[2]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[2]/div/p[1]": "<p>€&nbsp;5 per la donazione libera, in tutti i progetti.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[2]/div/p[2]": "<p>Per una ricompensa il minimo è il prezzo indicato accanto alla ricompensa.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[3]": "<details id=\"faq-registrazione\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[3]/summary": "<summary>Devo registrarmi per donare?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[3]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[3]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[3]/div/p": "<p>No. Servono solo nome, cognome ed email per la conferma.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[4]": "<details id=\"faq-metodi\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[4]/summary": "<summary>Come posso pagare e quanto costa?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[4]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[4]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[4]/div/p[1]": "<p>Puoi pagare con: Carta di credito, debito o prepagata, PayPal, Satispay, Bonifico bancario.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[4]/div/p[2]": "<p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[5]": "<details id=\"faq-pagamento-rifiutato\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[5]/summary": "<summary>Il pagamento non è andato a buon fine: che cosa faccio?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[5]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[5]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[5]/div/p[1]": "<p>Non è stato addebitato nulla. Puoi riprovare subito: i dati che hai inserito restano salvati.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[5]/div/p[2]": "<p>Prova un altro metodo di pagamento, per esempio il bonifico.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[5]/div/p[3]": "<p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[1]/details[5]/div/p[3]/a": "<a href=\"tel:+390110194250\">011 019 4250</a>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/h3[2]": "<h3>Regole della raccolta</h3>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]": "<div class=\"accordion\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[1]": "<details id=\"faq-tutto-o-niente\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[1]/summary": "<summary>Che cosa succede se il progetto non raggiunge l'obiettivo?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[1]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[1]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[1]/div/p[1]": "<p>Ti restituiamo la donazione: è la regola «tutto o niente».</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[1]/div/p[2]": "<p>Il rimborso arriva sullo stesso metodo di pagamento entro 15 giorni dalla scadenza. La commissione del pagamento non viene restituita.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[2]": "<details id=\"faq-oltre\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[2]/summary": "<summary>Il progetto ha già raggiunto l'obiettivo: serve ancora donare?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[2]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[2]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[2]/div/p[1]": "<p>Sì, finché la raccolta è aperta. Le donazioni in più servono al secondo obiettivo indicato nel riquadro del progetto.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[2]/div/p[2]": "<p>Le donazioni oltre l'obiettivo non vengono raddoppiate dall'Ateneo.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[3]": "<details id=\"faq-raddoppio\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[3]/summary": "<summary>Come funziona il raddoppio dell'Ateneo?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[3]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[3]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[3]/div/p[1]": "<p>Se un progetto del programma raggiunge l'obiettivo, l'Università aggiunge una cifra pari all'obiettivo, fino a €&nbsp;10.000. Per questo si parla anche di cofinanziamento.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[3]/div/p[2]": "<p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[2]/details[3]/div/p[2]/a": "<a href=\"programma.html#raddoppio\">Leggi un esempio</a>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/h3[3]": "<h3>Ricevuta, privacy e ricompense</h3>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]": "<div class=\"accordion\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]/details[1]": "<details id=\"faq-anonimo\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]/details[1]/summary": "<summary>Posso donare in forma anonima? Chi vede il mio nome?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]/details[1]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]/details[1]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]/details[1]/div/p[1]": "<p>Sì: nel modulo scegli «Dona in forma anonima». Il pubblico vede «Sostenitore anonimo».</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]/details[1]/div/p[2]": "<p>Il gruppo di ricerca riceve comunque nome ed email per ringraziarti e inviarti la ricompensa. L'importo non è mai pubblico.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]/details[2]": "<details id=\"faq-ricevuta\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]/details[2]/summary": "<summary>Riceverò una ricevuta? La donazione è detraibile?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]/details[2]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]/details[2]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]/details[2]/div/p[1]": "<p>Sì: dopo la donazione ricevi via email il riepilogo e la ricevuta fiscale.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]/details[2]/div/p[2]": "<p>La donazione all'Università è deducibile dal reddito: conserva la ricevuta per la dichiarazione dei redditi.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]/details[3]": "<details id=\"faq-ricompensa\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]/details[3]/summary": "<summary>Quando arriva la ricompensa?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]/details[3]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]/details[3]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[1]/div[3]/details[3]/div/p": "<p>Dopo la chiusura della raccolta, se l'obiettivo è raggiunto. Il gruppo ti scrive per chiederti l'indirizzo, se serve.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]": "<section id=\"promotori\" aria-labelledby=\"h-promotori\" data-faq-gruppo=\"\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/h2": "<h2 id=\"h-promotori\">Per chi propone un progetto</h2>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/h3[1]": "<h3>Partecipare</h3>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]": "<div class=\"accordion\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[1]": "<details id=\"faq-chi-propone\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[1]/summary": "<summary>Chi può proporre un progetto?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[1]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[1]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[1]/div/p[1]": "<p>Gruppi di ricerca dell'Università di Torino, con una persona strutturata come responsabile.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[1]/div/p[2]": "<p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[1]/div/p[2]/a": "<a href=\"proponi.html\">Leggi chi può proporre</a>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[2]": "<details id=\"faq-enti\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[2]/summary": "<summary>Siamo un'associazione o una scuola: possiamo partecipare?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[2]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[2]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[2]/div/p[1]": "<p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[2]/div/p[1]/a": "<a href=\"collabora.html\">proponete una collaborazione</a>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[2]/div/p[2]": "<p>Inviare la proposta non vi impegna e non ha costi.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[3]": "<details id=\"faq-scadenze\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[3]/summary": "<summary>Quando si può presentare una candidatura?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[3]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[3]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[3]/div/p": "<p>Una volta l'anno, con un bando. Per l'edizione 2027: dal 1° novembre 2026 al 31 marzo 2027.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[4]": "<details id=\"faq-costi\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[4]/summary": "<summary>Quanto costa proporre un progetto?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[4]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[4]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[4]/div/p[1]": "<p>Proporre una collaborazione è gratuito.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[1]/details[4]/div/p[2]": "<p>Anche per i gruppi selezionati dal programma non ci sono costi: formazione, accompagnamento e pubblicazione sono a carico dell'Ateneo.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/h3[2]": "<h3>Durante la campagna</h3>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]": "<div class=\"accordion\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[1]": "<details id=\"faq-durata\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[1]/summary": "<summary>Quanto dura una campagna?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[1]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[1]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[1]/div/p": "<p>Da 30 a 60 giorni.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[2]": "<details id=\"faq-aggiornamenti\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[2]/summary": "<summary>Come pubblichiamo aggiornamenti e il resoconto finale?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[2]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[2]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[2]/div/p[1]": "<p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[2]/div/p[1]/a": "<a href=\"mailto:programma@ideablume.it\">programma@ideablume.it</a>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[2]/div/p[2]": "<p>Alla fine chiediamo un resoconto con le spese, che inviamo anche ai sostenitori.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[3]": "<details id=\"faq-lingue\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[3]/summary": "<summary>Dobbiamo scrivere i contenuti in due lingue?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[3]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[3]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[3]/div/p": "<p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[2]/div[2]/details[3]/div/p/a": "<a href=\"proponi.html#gruppi\">Leggi le indicazioni</a>",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]": "<section id=\"generali\" aria-labelledby=\"h-generali\" data-faq-gruppo=\"\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/h2": "<h2 id=\"h-generali\">Domande generali</h2>",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/h3": "<h3>ideaBlume</h3>",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div": "<div class=\"accordion\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[1]": "<details id=\"faq-chi-gestisce\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[1]/summary": "<summary>Chi gestisce ideaBlume?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[1]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[1]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[1]/div/p": "<p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[1]/div/p/a": "<a href=\"chi-siamo.html\">Chi siamo</a>",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[2]": "<details id=\"faq-soldi\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[2]/summary": "<summary>Come so che i soldi arrivano davvero alla ricerca?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[2]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[2]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[2]/div/p[1]": "<p>Ogni progetto pubblica l'uso dei fondi voce per voce e, alla fine, un resoconto con le spese reali.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[2]/div/p[2]": "<p>I fondi vanno al dipartimento del gruppo, vincolati al progetto.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[3]": "<details id=\"faq-persona\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[3]/summary": "<summary>Come posso parlare con una persona?</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[3]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[3]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[3]/div/p": "<p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[3]/div/p/a[1]": "<a href=\"tel:+390110194250\">011 019 4250</a>",
  "//html/body/main/section[3]/div/details[3]/div/p/a[2]": "<a href=\"mailto:aiuto@ideablume.it\">aiuto@ideablume.it</a>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]": "<section id=\"parole\" aria-labelledby=\"h-parole\" data-faq-gruppo=\"\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/h2": "<h2 id=\"h-parole\">Le parole di ideaBlume</h2>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/h3[1]": "<h3>La raccolta</h3>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]": "<div class=\"accordion\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[1]": "<details id=\"parola-crowdfunding\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[1]/summary": "<summary>Crowdfunding</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[1]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[1]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[1]/div/p": "<p>Raccolta di denaro online: molte persone donano piccole cifre per realizzare un progetto.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[2]": "<details id=\"parola-obiettivo\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[2]/summary": "<summary>Obiettivo</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[2]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[2]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[2]/div/p": "<p>La cifra minima che il progetto deve raccogliere entro la scadenza. Se non la raggiunge, le donazioni vengono restituite.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[3]": "<details id=\"parola-tutto-o-niente\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[3]/summary": "<summary>Tutto o niente</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[3]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[3]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[3]/div/p": "<p>La regola di ideaBlume: il gruppo riceve i fondi solo se alla scadenza l'obiettivo è raggiunto. Altrimenti ti restituiamo la donazione.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[4]": "<details id=\"parola-secondo-obiettivo\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[4]/summary": "<summary>Secondo obiettivo</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[4]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[4]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[4]/div/p": "<p>Una cifra più alta, con uno scopo preciso, per i progetti che hanno già raggiunto l'obiettivo. Le donazioni oltre l'obiettivo servono a questo.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[5]": "<details id=\"parola-sostenitore\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[5]/summary": "<summary>Sostenitore</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[5]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[5]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[5]/div/p": "<p>Chi dona a un progetto.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[6]": "<details id=\"parola-gruppo\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[6]/summary": "<summary>Gruppo di ricerca</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[6]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[6]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[1]/details[6]/div/p": "<p>Le persone dell'Università che propongono e realizzano il progetto. Il responsabile scientifico guida il gruppo.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/h3[2]": "<h3>La donazione</h3>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[2]": "<div class=\"accordion\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[2]/details[1]": "<details id=\"parola-ricompensa\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[2]/details[1]/summary": "<summary>Ricompensa</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[2]/details[1]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[2]/details[1]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[2]/details[1]/div/p": "<p>Un piccolo ringraziamento del gruppo per chi dona almeno una certa cifra, per esempio una cartolina o una visita al laboratorio. Non è obbligatoria.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[2]/details[2]": "<details id=\"parola-donazione-libera\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[2]/details[2]/summary": "<summary>Donazione libera</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[2]/details[2]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[2]/details[2]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[2]/details[2]/div/p": "<p>Una donazione senza ricompensa, dell'importo che preferisci, da €&nbsp;5 in su.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[2]/details[3]": "<details id=\"parola-commissione\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[2]/details[3]/summary": "<summary>Commissione</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[2]/details[3]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[2]/details[3]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[2]/details[3]/div/p": "<p>Il costo applicato dal servizio di pagamento (carta, PayPal, Satispay). Lo vedi prima di confermare la donazione.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/h3[3]": "<h3>Il programma e i risultati</h3>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[3]": "<div class=\"accordion\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[3]/details[1]": "<details id=\"parola-programma\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[3]/details[1]/summary": "<summary>Programma dell'Ateneo</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[3]/details[1]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[3]/details[1]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[3]/details[1]/div/p": "<p>L'iniziativa con cui l'Università seleziona alcuni progetti, li accompagna e li cofinanzia.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[3]/details[2]": "<details id=\"parola-anno\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[3]/details[2]/summary": "<summary>Anno (edizione)</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[3]/details[2]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[3]/details[2]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[3]/details[2]/div/p": "<p>L'anno in cui si è svolta la campagna. Per i progetti del programma corrisponde all'edizione del programma.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[3]/details[3]": "<details id=\"parola-resoconto\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[3]/details[3]/summary": "<summary>Resoconto finale</summary>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[3]/details[3]/div": "<div class=\"accordion__content\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[3]/details[3]/div/br": "<br>",
  "//html/body/main/section[4]/div[3]/details[3]/div/p": "<p>Il testo in cui il gruppo racconta i risultati e come ha speso i fondi.</p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[5]": "<section class=\"infobox\" id=\"non-trovato\" aria-labelledby=\"h-nf\">",
  "//html/body/main/section[5]/h2": "<h2 id=\"h-nf\">Non hai trovato la risposta?</h2>",
  "//html/body/main/section[5]/p": "<p>",
  "//html/body/main/section[5]/p/a[1]": "<a href=\"tel:+390110194250\">011 019 4250</a>",
  "//html/body/main/section[5]/p/a[2]": "<a href=\"mailto:aiuto@ideablume.it\">aiuto@ideablume.it</a>",
  "//html/body/main/p[2]": "<p class=\"small muted\">Ultimo aggiornamento: 9 novembre 2026</p>",
  "//html/body/main/p[3]": "<p>",
  "//html/body/main/p[3]/a": "<a class=\"back-to-top\" href=\"#main\">↑ Torna su</a>",
